# HR360 — Frontend Traceability Document

**Document ID:** HR360-FE-005
**Version:** 1.0
**Status:** Draft for Review
**Date:** 20 September 2026
**Prepared By:** Nida Khan

## 1. Purpose

This document establishes traceability between business requirements and the HR360 frontend implementation.

## 2. Traceability Chain

```text
BRD
 ↓
Business Rule
 ↓
FRD
 ↓
User Story
 ↓
Acceptance Criteria
 ↓
API
 ↓
Frontend Page
 ↓
React Component
 ↓
Frontend Test
```

