## 9. Planned Functionality

The following remains planned:

**FR-REC-010 / US-REC-009**

Accepted job offer → employee record creation.

## 10. Traceability Governance

Any new frontend functionality shall be linked to:

* Business requirement
* Functional requirement
* User story
* Acceptance criteria
* API or system area
* Frontend component
* Test case

This prevents undocumented functionality from being added to the application.

